+# Billing disputes
+
+Use this context for customer refund and invoice questions.
+
+- Refund requests are governed by the 30-day refund window defined by `refundWindowDays` in `/src/billing.ts`.
+- `/src/billing.ts` establishes no invoice-specific policy. Do not invent invoice terms or outcomes; escalate invoice disputes that cannot be resolved from other project evidence.

